msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:23
msgid "Craft beer from the edge of the Arctic Circle"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:158
msgid "Craft beer from the edge of the Arctic Circle. Brewed locally. Enjoyed globally. Translated for everyone."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:51
msgid "Every bottle tells a story in any language."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:82
msgid "Every ingredient comes from within 200 kilometres of the brewery. Our barley grows in fields that see midnight sun. Our water filters through volcanic rock for a thousand years before it reaches us."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:27
msgid "Explore our beers"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:28
msgid "Find the taproom"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:115
msgid "Fire brewed, ice cold"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:92
msgid "From a village of 400 people to bottle shops in 12 countries. The beer doesn't change when it crosses a border. The labels do. We translate everything because someone on the other side deserves to know what they're drinking."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:150
msgid "Get in touch"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:35
msgid "Going global, staying local."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:25
msgid "Great beer doesn't need translation, but great stories do. We brew in a place where the northern lights dance across the sky and the water runs so pure it doesn't need filtering. From our tiny brewery above the 66th parallel, we send bottles to every corner of the world."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:69
msgid "Heated with birchwood from the forest behind the brewery. The smoke adds a whisper of flavour you won't find anywhere else. So dark you can't see through it. We ship this one everywhere and the label is in six languages because people kept asking."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:140
msgid "hello@northernlightsbrewing.no<0/>Or just show up. We're always here."
msgstr ""

