#: src/App.jsx:148
msgid "Life's too short to drink beer you can't read about."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:135
msgid "Location"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:61
msgid "Midnight Sun Lager"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:10
#: src/App.jsx:157
msgid "Northern Lights Brewing Co."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:77
msgid "Old methods, new reach."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:108
msgid "Our labels are printed in Norwegian, English, German, Japanese, Spanish and French. Not because we had to. Because someone in Osaka wrote us a letter saying they couldn't read the back of the bottle, and that felt wrong. Now every word on every bottle is in every language we ship to."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:104
msgid "Our spent grain feeds the cattle next door. Our wastewater irrigates the barley fields. The bottles come back, get washed, and go out again. Nothing leaves the loop. Sustainability isn't a marketing word here. It's just Tuesday."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:12
#: src/App.jsx:34
#: src/App.jsx:164
msgid "Our Story"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:128
msgid "People come from all over. Last month we had visitors from Tokyo, Buenos Aires, and a town in Latvia we'd never heard of. They all said the same thing: this is worth the trip. We think so too, but we're biased."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:175
msgid "Press"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:112
msgid "Seven people run this entire brewery. We don't have a marketing department. We have a brewer who writes the copy, a designer who draws the labels, and five people who do everything else. Going international didn't require more people. It required better systems."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:91
msgid "Ship everywhere"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:173
msgid "Shipping"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:111
msgid "Small team, big world"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:136
msgid "Somewhere above the 66th parallel<0/>Follow the fjord, turn at the red barn"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:81
msgid "Source locally"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:107
msgid "Speak every language"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:174
msgid "Stockists"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:15
#: src/App.jsx:167
msgid "Taproom"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:57
msgid "Tastes like walking through a pine forest after rain. We forage the tips ourselves in late spring when the new growth is still bright green. Bitter enough to wake you up, smooth enough to keep you drinking."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:13
#: src/App.jsx:50
#: src/App.jsx:165
msgid "The Beers"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:123
msgid "The Taproom"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:127
msgid "The taproom seats 30 people. We don't take reservations. The menu changes every week because we brew what we feel like brewing. Bring cash or card, we don't mind. Bring your own glass and we'll knock a krone off your first pour."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:39
msgid "Three friends who met at a fishing village in northern Norway. One brewed beer in her garage. One ran a boat. One couldn't stop talking about how the whole world should taste this. That last one was probably right."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:132
msgid "Thursday — Sunday<0/>14:00 — 22:00"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:16
msgid "Visit Us"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:116
msgid "We heat our kettles with birchwood. We cool our tanks with Arctic air. Old methods produce things that new methods can't replicate. The world has enough industrial lager. It doesn't need another one from us."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:126
msgid "We're open Thursday to Sunday, tucked into the side of a hill above the fjord. There's no sign on the road because everyone around here already knows where we are. If you're visiting from somewhere else, follow the smell."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:43
msgid "What began as a local obsession is now reaching bars and bottle shops across borders and time zones. We didn't plan to go international. The beer just started showing up in places we'd never been. Turns out good things don't need a passport, just a bottle cap."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:99
msgid "What We Believe"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:38
msgid "Where it started"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:42
msgid "Where it's going"
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:149
msgid "Whether you're in Oslo, Osaka, or that town in Latvia, we want you to know exactly what's in your glass. Every ingredient, every story, every word. In your language."
msgstr ""

#: src/App.jsx:103
msgid "Zero waste, full flavour"
msgstr ""
